# New Forever dungeon. Source: foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/blackmaw-hold (level range is Blizzard's). The page lists
# 5 Horde quests, takeable from level 45-55, without their givers.
@dungeon Blackmaw Hold
@levels 55-60
@window 53-60
@best 56
@hub Azshara, 22.0, 52.0, 12
@hub Orgrimmar, 50.0, 50.0
@entrance none
RUN | New Forever dungeon, not checked in game yet. It is a furbolg city behind the big gate in Azshara. Jediga in Valormok (Azshara 22.6, 51.4) gives Beneath Nordrassil, which sends you to Nara Wildmane on Elder Rise in Thunder Bluff (75.8, 31.1) for Get to the Roots of It. Ogtinc (Azshara 42.4, 42.6) gives Claws That Rend, Tusks that Gore. Ekkal at the Ruins of Eldarath (Azshara 42.0, 38.9) gives Blackmaw Pouches. The Twin Bears goes to Lorekeeper Nok at Ursolan; his exact spot is not known. Take what is offered; the addon logs it so these steps can be filled in.
